{"editionId":"pep-chinese-g1-upper-2022-standard","gradeCode":"primary_1","guides":{"characters-around":{"choices":[{"art":{"alt":"找书包","panel":3,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":6.27,"sha256":"d6745591a17c4f0e57a1d2f85bb20b36a16a1cf8f32ecb3397dcb89c9a07ce9d","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/d6745591a17c4f0e57a1d2f85bb20b36a16a1cf8f32ecb3397dcb89c9a07ce9d.mp3"},"caption":"找书包","narration":"小书包里有什么？先找一本书，再找一个笔袋。你的书包里，也有这些东西吗？"},{"art":{"alt":"找小物件","panel":2,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.877,"sha256":"e7bcfcfb5f726d7627b432d95f410f28a95f9a625c4e536e405218845a7d0f12","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/e7bcfcfb5f726d7627b432d95f410f28a95f9a625c4e536e405218845a7d0f12.mp3"},"caption":"找小物件","narration":"看看桌上的小东西。找出一片叶子，再找出一个木块。你是根据颜色，还是形状找到它们的？"},{"art":{"alt":"找小伙伴","panel":1,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.935,"sha256":"204815f51475e03af2a9c2c38c92a711ce420ce7e4b7f026df117d7a08b19503","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/204815f51475e03af2a9c2c38c92a711ce420ce7e4b7f026df117d7a08b19503.mp3"},"caption":"找小伙伴","narration":"小伙伴伸出了手。你也伸出手，轻轻挥一挥。很多汉字，就跟我们熟悉的身体和动作有关。"}],"gradeCode":"primary_1","presentationSha256":"f93346756a2b945f18bfbc10530e8e5fe822aed075eb15a604ad8cac7f58e5c6","scenes":[{"art":{"alt":"打开小书包","panel":3,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":10.999,"sha256":"d7f9334ff57454b79d3c475e0795ce4eca87e99f9ff48ef9cbb3aa30ee33ee5a","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/d7f9334ff57454b79d3c475e0795ce4eca87e99f9ff48ef9cbb3aa30ee33ee5a.mp3"},"caption":"打开小书包","narration":"小书包里有书，也有笔袋。我们能看见、摸到的许多东西，都有自己的名字。认识汉字，能帮我们记住这些名字。"},{"art":{"alt":"选一个身边的朋友","panel":2,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":7.651,"sha256":"9153cb4ce87f7cb1a87164a233b0583f85f34b42855cf9251a67af5ec5a51268","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/9153cb4ce87f7cb1a87164a233b0583f85f34b42855cf9251a67af5ec5a51268.mp3"},"caption":"选一个身边的朋友","narration":"你想先看看书包里的东西，桌上的小物件，还是身边的小伙伴？点一幅图，仔细找一找。"},{"art":{"alt":"拿一样，说名字","panel":3,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.604,"sha256":"c295a79d0949096969df03fefa6046c357b102dc5dfc2b9b8a178894c057933f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/c295a79d0949096969df03fefa6046c357b102dc5dfc2b9b8a178894c057933f.mp3"},"caption":"拿一样，说名字","narration":"从你的书包里，拿出一样安全的小东西。告诉家人它叫什么，再说一句，我用它来做什么。不会写名字，也可以先说出来。"},{"art":{"alt":"生活里，继续找","panel":2,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":12.982,"sha256":"4f8333b16d21f9a2e9e55257e7ad648e67e10c4e45590ebac8d0a82c4e843817","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/4f8333b16d21f9a2e9e55257e7ad648e67e10c4e45590ebac8d0a82c4e843817.mp3"},"caption":"生活里，继续找","narration":"你已经会看图，也会把发现说出来了。接下来，我们会在课本里认识新的朋友，听新的故事。带着你的好奇心，一起出发吧！"}],"schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide.v1","sourceContentSha256":"1ebc8ff10eada2946989eab1d847fb335d8d433b4831cde1eac1bbda5cacf921","title":"汉字藏在哪儿？"},"chinese-welcome":{"choices":[{"art":{"alt":"打招呼","panel":0,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.846,"sha256":"e8b3826e2ca7d29c30b3ccbc951fdc9abc19965e9d9a077f3c665b91c4f92df7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/e8b3826e2ca7d29c30b3ccbc951fdc9abc19965e9d9a077f3c665b91c4f92df7.mp3"},"caption":"打招呼","narration":"对朋友说一声你好，再告诉他你的名字。你刚刚就在用语文啦！试着说，我叫，接上你自己的名字。"},{"art":{"alt":"找小鸟","panel":1,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":10.744,"sha256":"f438d288cf000a9f0ca8e285b457d7b9772474c05497182b6777b4c6eb1df897","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/f438d288cf000a9f0ca8e285b457d7b9772474c05497182b6777b4c6eb1df897.mp3"},"caption":"找小鸟","narration":"你看见小鸟了吗？指一指它在哪里。再说一句，我看见一只小鸟。把看到的说出来，也是语文。"},{"art":{"alt":"看图书","panel":2,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":12.38,"sha256":"fcf5bec32edeb5f17dd33158c7e02241e6e1058b920134ec64ddce811ca67249","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/fcf5bec32edeb5f17dd33158c7e02241e6e1058b920134ec64ddce811ca67249.mp3"},"caption":"看图书","narration":"图画也会讲故事！先看一看，再猜一猜，图里的小朋友接下来会做什么。你的想法，可以跟家人说一说。"}],"gradeCode":"primary_1","presentationSha256":"a89fe90b49e4bc4083de6cdbe1d4684a7b74ebf6337ffe946407799ae35ad3ae","scenes":[{"art":{"alt":"挥挥手，交朋友","panel":0,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.686,"sha256":"54ea96526c29cfe9237c32eda0ebc01d22b41738581979db637521fd3cc184d7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/54ea96526c29cfe9237c32eda0ebc01d22b41738581979db637521fd3cc184d7.mp3"},"caption":"挥挥手，交朋友","narration":"你好呀！我是米拉老师。看，两个小朋友在校门口见面了。你也挥挥手，跟他们说一声，你好！一句话，就能让我们认识新朋友。"},{"art":{"alt":"你想先看哪一幅？","panel":1,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.97,"sha256":"d249ab752078778a429b0ffc0ff620652e9d8ac8f60435de531c1808333b5799","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/d249ab752078778a429b0ffc0ff620652e9d8ac8f60435de531c1808333b5799.mp3"},"caption":"你想先看哪一幅？","narration":"语文藏在哪儿呢？下面有三幅小画。点点你喜欢的那幅，听听它的小秘密。每一幅都可以选。"},{"art":{"alt":"画一画，说一说","panel":3,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":13.322,"sha256":"e56764ff930e31c6805f383db7e62d97f0941187095e0993827a43c579cb63a9","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/e56764ff930e31c6805f383db7e62d97f0941187095e0993827a43c579cb63a9.mp3"},"caption":"画一画，说一说","narration":"拿一张纸，画一个你喜欢的东西。不会写字也没关系。画好以后，指着它，说一句，这是我的什么。现在停下来，试试看吧。"},{"art":{"alt":"带着发现，出发！","panel":2,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":12.982,"sha256":"4f8333b16d21f9a2e9e55257e7ad648e67e10c4e45590ebac8d0a82c4e843817","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/4f8333b16d21f9a2e9e55257e7ad648e67e10c4e45590ebac8d0a82c4e843817.mp3"},"caption":"带着发现，出发！","narration":"你已经会看图，也会把发现说出来了。接下来，我们会在课本里认识新的朋友，听新的故事。带着你的好奇心，一起出发吧！"}],"schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide.v1","sourceContentSha256":"a367001db841f4c8a19f8c0d0a4ca1f73d495a41f872aba03079614ff0066dd6","title":"语文小发现"},"discover-characters":{"choices":[{"art":{"alt":"看天空","panel":0,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.162,"sha256":"024287e53d4335aa4b6cdc3df141864449da5bb9a51ae67eab73b041c9259d38","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/024287e53d4335aa4b6cdc3df141864449da5bb9a51ae67eab73b041c9259d38.mp3"},"caption":"看天空","narration":"图里的天空是什么颜色？你窗外的天空又是什么样？抬头看一看，说出一个你发现的不同。"},{"art":{"alt":"找自己","panel":1,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":7.215,"sha256":"71867a965232bd74c53c1ae6b096559ab6063924957c44b7d1fa820c89d7f91e","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/71867a965232bd74c53c1ae6b096559ab6063924957c44b7d1fa820c89d7f91e.mp3"},"caption":"找自己","narration":"小朋友在向你挥手呢。你用哪儿听声音？用哪儿看图画？指给家人看一看吧。"},{"art":{"alt":"看小东西","panel":2,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.331,"sha256":"12542a77675856c36be0c029a2d15b74cb4c66eb6f63f6cc9112e7775954d9d3","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/12542a77675856c36be0c029a2d15b74cb4c66eb6f63f6cc9112e7775954d9d3.mp3"},"caption":"看小东西","narration":"桌上有小石头、叶子和木块。你想拿起哪一个看一看？说说它的颜色，或者摸起来会是什么感觉。"}],"gradeCode":"primary_1","presentationSha256":"71d2da5052edea40006b367db0d13912d664018735dd711b0b18593c685ea3f1","scenes":[{"art":{"alt":"抬头看，低头找","panel":0,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":12.627,"sha256":"d41fdf8d3925604ed41870692c6b3d0389799c2bbd47c8b41e6825b6cf38d8cd","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/d41fdf8d3925604ed41870692c6b3d0389799c2bbd47c8b41e6825b6cf38d8cd.mp3"},"caption":"抬头看，低头找","narration":"抬头看看，蓝蓝的天空在上面。低头看看，脚下是大地。小朋友站在天地之间。汉字呀，可以帮我们记住这些熟悉的朋友。"},{"art":{"alt":"先认识谁呢？","panel":1,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":7.217,"sha256":"936f934cb5c43d7caa630b319bab11dc93720ec62e0b9ec04905ea7bf74fcb1c","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/936f934cb5c43d7caa630b319bab11dc93720ec62e0b9ec04905ea7bf74fcb1c.mp3"},"caption":"先认识谁呢？","narration":"天空、小伙伴，还有身边的小东西，你想先看看哪一个？点一幅图，听老师说。"},{"art":{"alt":"指一指，挥挥手","panel":1,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":10.482,"sha256":"677c66c18d685726793f963beae2d89b090d882a7b083f0401ef403562897603","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/677c66c18d685726793f963beae2d89b090d882a7b083f0401ef403562897603.mp3"},"caption":"指一指，挥挥手","narration":"请你用手指一指自己的眼睛，再指一指耳朵。最后挥挥小手。我们的身体会做这么多事情，真有趣。"},{"art":{"alt":"把发现带进课本","panel":0,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":10.402,"sha256":"64b62df8cb4e0d63906958279a6d5420f8aaabebd1c29f676baf7d0a95556bd6","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/64b62df8cb4e0d63906958279a6d5420f8aaabebd1c29f676baf7d0a95556bd6.mp3"},"caption":"把发现带进课本","narration":"你已经找到了天空、大地，还有自己。翻开课本，我们会遇见记录它们的汉字。先听，再看，慢慢认识它们就好。"}],"schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide.v1","sourceContentSha256":"7efb2b7954228518a33212452e7b7de21aeb84a2758bfd4f714368ebba50fd81","title":"身边的汉字朋友"},"discover-sounds":{"choices":[{"art":{"alt":"看嘴巴","panel":0,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":12.036,"sha256":"f7c56b109646fb504fc2b0c471301083b0c76c4e1c53a46a88ff704f5b393584","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/f7c56b109646fb504fc2b0c471301083b0c76c4e1c53a46a88ff704f5b393584.mp3"},"caption":"看嘴巴","narration":"小女孩正在看镜子。你说话的时候，嘴巴会变样子。对着镜子轻轻说一句你好，看一看嘴巴怎么动。"},{"art":{"alt":"听小鸟","panel":2,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":7.733,"sha256":"152d6fdda600408731739f6fe076dcaabeeff9ed7312ca2fff5219ca93201d83","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/152d6fdda600408731739f6fe076dcaabeeff9ed7312ca2fff5219ca93201d83.mp3"},"caption":"听小鸟","narration":"小朋友停下来听小鸟。现在也请你安静一会儿，找一个近处的声音，再找一个远处的声音。"},{"art":{"alt":"拍拍手","panel":3,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.163,"sha256":"06c474b2b724f98f3be1471b3c6abdd9800155f3435e4a4ee4a349887cee2515","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/06c474b2b724f98f3be1471b3c6abdd9800155f3435e4a4ee4a349887cee2515.mp3"},"caption":"拍拍手","narration":"轻轻拍一下手，再拍两下。听听声音之间有没有停顿。可以请家人拍一个简单的节奏，你跟着试一试。"}],"gradeCode":"primary_1","presentationSha256":"55a3d9332dd5dcf3c79057d8a9dc845d7f1c4674fdb81b7c4aa7a966624ae1ac","scenes":[{"art":{"alt":"听，谁在唱歌？","panel":2,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.884,"sha256":"20deefb73ba9182c1cd97a60dbe94aefc0d054365b78848285d03e15910057bd","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/20deefb73ba9182c1cd97a60dbe94aefc0d054365b78848285d03e15910057bd.mp3"},"caption":"听，谁在唱歌？","narration":"小鸟在树上叫，小朋友停下来认真听。你身边现在有什么声音？先安静一小会儿，用耳朵找找看。"},{"art":{"alt":"点一幅，玩声音","panel":0,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.676,"sha256":"3b7a131860e1ac33aa125cb9bfa8f3f65c1c2b8b64c2597994e8882ab0cd75f3","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/3b7a131860e1ac33aa125cb9bfa8f3f65c1c2b8b64c2597994e8882ab0cd75f3.mp3"},"caption":"点一幅，玩声音","narration":"小嘴巴会动，小耳朵会听，双手还会拍出声音。你想先玩哪一个？点点下面的图。"},{"art":{"alt":"照镜子，动动嘴","panel":0,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":13.236,"sha256":"7fba5314bbfa4574d5fd152a523e381b4c10653aa61103ee7dfcfc0c46a0c52c","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/7fba5314bbfa4574d5fd152a523e381b4c10653aa61103ee7dfcfc0c46a0c52c.mp3"},"caption":"照镜子，动动嘴","narration":"找一面安全的小镜子。张开嘴，再轻轻合上。看看嘴巴的样子有什么变化。等学拼音时，我们也会一边听，一边看嘴巴。"},{"art":{"alt":"带上耳朵，出发！","panel":1,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.766,"sha256":"f5b629e179993a6d028e4f00c6e92cb07dca59fbf7ffd7fc0298c78b286de899","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/f5b629e179993a6d028e4f00c6e92cb07dca59fbf7ffd7fc0298c78b286de899.mp3"},"caption":"带上耳朵，出发！","narration":"听清楚，再试着说出来，就是今天的小本领。不用急着记住字母。接下来，让老师带着你，一个声音、一个声音地认识拼音。"}],"schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide.v1","sourceContentSha256":"95234a1f21536e0530c7dfaeb9b3a39a15ec0cd494bb992499c56c854a9908be","title":"声音来做客"},"read-and-imagine":{"choices":[{"art":{"alt":"弯弯月亮","panel":0,"sha256":"f97f6d39064e812ffa6b570a8c39c7fd86eb1f9a31f0a5ca20671cd68fc2bc5b","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/imagination-f97f6d39064e812f.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":7.651,"sha256":"d5c5ba3b98b429823f452e92ac73cc53cf70397c76b14e0c12e542316ed21d80","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/d5c5ba3b98b429823f452e92ac73cc53cf70397c76b14e0c12e542316ed21d80.mp3"},"caption":"弯弯月亮","narration":"月亮弯弯的。你觉得它像小船，还是像别的东西？没有固定答案，说说你的想法吧。"},{"art":{"alt":"有趣影子","panel":1,"sha256":"f97f6d39064e812ffa6b570a8c39c7fd86eb1f9a31f0a5ca20671cd68fc2bc5b","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/imagination-f97f6d39064e812f.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.594,"sha256":"bc4a3388450b6ad6d4c1b4d7969e343ac4f980ce17f78fe513c613c75a930e89","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/bc4a3388450b6ad6d4c1b4d7969e343ac4f980ce17f78fe513c613c75a930e89.mp3"},"caption":"有趣影子","narration":"小女孩的手在墙上变出了影子。你觉得这个影子像什么？同一幅影子，也可能有不同的想法。"},{"art":{"alt":"我的小画","panel":2,"sha256":"f97f6d39064e812ffa6b570a8c39c7fd86eb1f9a31f0a5ca20671cd68fc2bc5b","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/imagination-f97f6d39064e812f.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.622,"sha256":"bc5f2a7c37eb2383da91e982b9e2cbc6b1a95d9973d8b1742a53f83660843c38","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/bc5f2a7c37eb2383da91e982b9e2cbc6b1a95d9973d8b1742a53f83660843c38.mp3"},"caption":"我的小画","narration":"图里的小女孩把月亮画成了小船。你会把弯弯的形状变成什么？可以先想一想，再画出来。"}],"gradeCode":"primary_1","presentationSha256":"238b16c5928830c54afa4e89266731ee56b11ea4ceb2ecefb8ca32f420654b44","scenes":[{"art":{"alt":"月亮像什么？","panel":0,"sha256":"f97f6d39064e812ffa6b570a8c39c7fd86eb1f9a31f0a5ca20671cd68fc2bc5b","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/imagination-f97f6d39064e812f.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.343,"sha256":"e684dc92031f8fc4c54151d821c7daeffa5417bb696bc2335747c4f21e10e6c4","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/e684dc92031f8fc4c54151d821c7daeffa5417bb696bc2335747c4f21e10e6c4.mp3"},"caption":"月亮像什么？","narration":"天慢慢暗下来，弯弯的月亮出来了。看着这轮月亮，你想到了什么？可以像小船，也可以像别的东西。你的想法很有趣。"},{"art":{"alt":"选一幅，想一想","panel":2,"sha256":"f97f6d39064e812ffa6b570a8c39c7fd86eb1f9a31f0a5ca20671cd68fc2bc5b","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/imagination-f97f6d39064e812f.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":7.818,"sha256":"23c69dcec579814a9ce93ce31d6d35d3d882c7aec3e2eac5ae59eb9ea68b86d0","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/23c69dcec579814a9ce93ce31d6d35d3d882c7aec3e2eac5ae59eb9ea68b86d0.mp3"},"caption":"选一幅，想一想","narration":"月亮、影子，还有一张画，都能带我们去想象。选一幅图，把你的想法说出来。"},{"art":{"alt":"画出你的想象","panel":2,"sha256":"f97f6d39064e812ffa6b570a8c39c7fd86eb1f9a31f0a5ca20671cd68fc2bc5b","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/imagination-f97f6d39064e812f.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.626,"sha256":"866e627235435c4acdf8dbd61373b5ca0313c6a6eab0a0b4f99993e0f8b58ecc","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/866e627235435c4acdf8dbd61373b5ca0313c6a6eab0a0b4f99993e0f8b58ecc.mp3"},"caption":"画出你的想象","narration":"在纸上画一个弯弯的形状，再添几笔，把它变成你想到的东西。画好以后，告诉家人，我觉得它像什么。"},{"art":{"alt":"听故事，想画面","panel":3,"sha256":"f97f6d39064e812ffa6b570a8c39c7fd86eb1f9a31f0a5ca20671cd68fc2bc5b","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/imagination-f97f6d39064e812f.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.171,"sha256":"390276e54509fdd5b9028061fb3e3b20add746dbd49f904429a91ab175d8ac8a","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/390276e54509fdd5b9028061fb3e3b20add746dbd49f904429a91ab175d8ac8a.mp3"},"caption":"听故事，想画面","narration":"把你的画给家人看一看。以后听课文时，也可以在脑海里画画。想一想，故事里的景色和人物，会是什么样子呢？"}],"schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide.v1","sourceContentSha256":"d6ce0fc8279a7b8850499a7d7a838782163384bf994aedff57f82371eb3bf44e","title":"想象的小船"},"season-discovery":{"choices":[{"art":{"alt":"荷叶绿绿","panel":1,"sha256":"a0e75b52ba85fd326622fff869245f055664345781fa408bf975de66a86e3b18","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/seasons-a0e75b52ba85fd32.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.334,"sha256":"8562bc7145df0076b052b33e491e5c1e3c17dc563145ec31c66a6725ee473dbb","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/8562bc7145df0076b052b33e491e5c1e3c17dc563145ec31c66a6725ee473dbb.mp3"},"caption":"荷叶绿绿","narration":"绿绿的荷叶旁，有一只小蜻蜓。你发现它了吗？用手指一指，再说说你还看见了什么。"},{"art":{"alt":"落叶黄黄","panel":2,"sha256":"a0e75b52ba85fd326622fff869245f055664345781fa408bf975de66a86e3b18","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/seasons-a0e75b52ba85fd32.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.108,"sha256":"00e39606cd0329ee2ca5091a04656e8981e5dea6446de6b2ca7b13dca2a7d9bd","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/00e39606cd0329ee2ca5091a04656e8981e5dea6446de6b2ca7b13dca2a7d9bd.mp3"},"caption":"落叶黄黄","narration":"小女孩捡起一片金黄的叶子。你见过什么颜色的叶子？想一想，把你的发现告诉家人。"},{"art":{"alt":"白白的雪","panel":3,"sha256":"a0e75b52ba85fd326622fff869245f055664345781fa408bf975de66a86e3b18","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/seasons-a0e75b52ba85fd32.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.079,"sha256":"6a370596f5656749eed0a26f233a7c9e5026af9e43583c101cf4c09f60d4b4c0","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/6a370596f5656749eed0a26f233a7c9e5026af9e43583c101cf4c09f60d4b4c0.mp3"},"caption":"白白的雪","narration":"白白的雪上有一串小脚印。你猜，是谁留下的？看看旁边的小动物，说说你的想法。"}],"gradeCode":"primary_1","presentationSha256":"2150975fc640c075a5712db6170844b7f3905df95036698c6b9dd4bcbe2c29e3","scenes":[{"art":{"alt":"树枝上，有新朋友","panel":0,"sha256":"a0e75b52ba85fd326622fff869245f055664345781fa408bf975de66a86e3b18","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/seasons-a0e75b52ba85fd32.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.09,"sha256":"08c6b057d06eb9562e0c8a53ca907a64a888788d30c194da00f54a1bc5a7aa2f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/08c6b057d06eb9562e0c8a53ca907a64a888788d30c194da00f54a1bc5a7aa2f.mp3"},"caption":"树枝上，有新朋友","narration":"看，树枝上开出了粉粉的小花，地上也长出了新草。小女孩停下来仔细看。大自然每天都会悄悄变化。"},{"art":{"alt":"你想走进哪幅画？","panel":2,"sha256":"a0e75b52ba85fd326622fff869245f055664345781fa408bf975de66a86e3b18","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/seasons-a0e75b52ba85fd32.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.536,"sha256":"3a5cebb161638cf5ce43a5342d3d5b4b49c5827dd3ffdf5707a58c3bd1fd54b7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/3a5cebb161638cf5ce43a5342d3d5b4b49c5827dd3ffdf5707a58c3bd1fd54b7.mp3"},"caption":"你想走进哪幅画？","narration":"下面有绿绿的荷叶、金黄的落叶，还有白白的雪。选一幅喜欢的画，听听老师的问题。"},{"art":{"alt":"找一种颜色","panel":2,"sha256":"a0e75b52ba85fd326622fff869245f055664345781fa408bf975de66a86e3b18","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/seasons-a0e75b52ba85fd32.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":12.891,"sha256":"5e86b52baf02b3e7b2959899ba52f332c0d2a32275bf2465dddf2fa6afc4b4b7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/5e86b52baf02b3e7b2959899ba52f332c0d2a32275bf2465dddf2fa6afc4b4b7.mp3"},"caption":"找一种颜色","narration":"看看窗外，或者回想今天上学的路。找一种你看见的颜色，说一说，它藏在哪里。不需要走出去，在家里想一想也可以。"},{"art":{"alt":"带着画面，读一读","panel":3,"sha256":"a0e75b52ba85fd326622fff869245f055664345781fa408bf975de66a86e3b18","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/seasons-a0e75b52ba85fd32.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.173,"sha256":"7656acdb06a91ea92dd9da49f42321de0a529a883c7cbca64e76bd6ce30502fb","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/7656acdb06a91ea92dd9da49f42321de0a529a883c7cbca64e76bd6ce30502fb.mp3"},"caption":"带着画面，读一读","narration":"不同的季节，有不同的颜色和声音。以后读到课文里的大自然，先听老师读，再在心里想一幅画。我们的阅读旅行开始啦。"}],"schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide.v1","sourceContentSha256":"cffad2586df4d03c4cd6c018fd753979146fb0e0ffdeb39a608bcaf9b66c1034","title":"四季来做客"},"sound-details":{"choices":[{"art":{"alt":"看嘴巴","panel":0,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.005,"sha256":"73a586ae9cf73575d21bb9001f20a5e09eeb3eafc2f4666bb023a9093abac481","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/73a586ae9cf73575d21bb9001f20a5e09eeb3eafc2f4666bb023a9093abac481.mp3"},"caption":"看嘴巴","narration":"试着轻轻张嘴，再把嘴巴合上。镜子里的样子变了吗？观察小变化，可以帮我们听懂老师怎样发音。"},{"art":{"alt":"轮流说","panel":1,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.764,"sha256":"3c24852bd0190dee48d899aecd266a9ceeafebd3bf6b5306aaacd724c4428b82","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/3c24852bd0190dee48d899aecd266a9ceeafebd3bf6b5306aaacd724c4428b82.mp3"},"caption":"轮流说","narration":"请家人说你好，你听完再说。然后交换一下。听别人说完，是个很有用的小习惯。"},{"art":{"alt":"听节奏","panel":3,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.97,"sha256":"9641be72e781717b2f58ecfc45bffe09e56b83168366bbc34f159a0d13fcadd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/9641be72e781717b2f58ecfc45bffe09e56b83168366bbc34f159a0d13fcadd7.mp3"},"caption":"听节奏","narration":"轻轻拍两下，中间停一会儿，再拍一下。请家人照着拍。你们听到的顺序一样吗？"}],"gradeCode":"primary_1","presentationSha256":"c6f99c12c0d5d4f95fef7e8073dfd26f412be44e72dadc11cb8a071b29ec86a9","scenes":[{"art":{"alt":"听清了，再开口","panel":1,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.946,"sha256":"198bfb440c6e55b788d40a594d01dcf696f32b2c88fefbcc604e56445f9d898c","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/198bfb440c6e55b788d40a594d01dcf696f32b2c88fefbcc604e56445f9d898c.mp3"},"caption":"听清了，再开口","narration":"看，一个小朋友在说，另一个在听。有些声音很像。先认真听完，再试一试，会比着急开口更容易发现不同。"},{"art":{"alt":"你想怎么找不同？","panel":0,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":7.904,"sha256":"bafc907a82efc76a02afeedb873e1b8a835a607b9208514a4e4036000bf3be25","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/bafc907a82efc76a02afeedb873e1b8a835a607b9208514a4e4036000bf3be25.mp3"},"caption":"你想怎么找不同？","narration":"可以看嘴巴，也可以听声音，还可以拍节奏。点一幅图，挑一个你想试的小办法。"},{"art":{"alt":"你说一句，我来学","panel":1,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":10.744,"sha256":"810c8128d9d4e87a2c837461d439b6309fb104bc2cd6fda4654985c4008a9317","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/810c8128d9d4e87a2c837461d439b6309fb104bc2cd6fda4654985c4008a9317.mp3"},"caption":"你说一句，我来学","narration":"请家人慢慢说一句你好。先听完，再学着说。然后换你说，家人来学。听一听，你们说得一样吗？"},{"art":{"alt":"小变化，也能发现","panel":0,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":10.916,"sha256":"f265d308c83e7e1c382770838959df46cb61eae1eb631e2ac9df6cb6abd22274","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/f265d308c83e7e1c382770838959df46cb61eae1eb631e2ac9df6cb6abd22274.mp3"},"caption":"小变化，也能发现","narration":"你的耳朵和眼睛，都是学习的小帮手。到了拼音课堂，我们继续听老师的示范，看清嘴巴的变化，一次练一点。"}],"schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide.v1","sourceContentSha256":"af3b513d3e54c03d83f0c39a75cb1d5579a33b6c54f05743ea45ec83feb5ac7d","title":"小耳朵，大发现"},"sounds-together":{"choices":[{"art":{"alt":"先听后说","panel":1,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.934,"sha256":"376c0849028474561dd03b63654b801673fbd2a12c1750e1689bf362b8bdd024","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/376c0849028474561dd03b63654b801673fbd2a12c1750e1689bf362b8bdd024.mp3"},"caption":"先听后说","narration":"小朋友正在轮流说话。先听完对方的一句话，再用自己的声音试一遍。不要着急抢着说。"},{"art":{"alt":"看看嘴巴","panel":0,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.078,"sha256":"86469c0fecf7778ae8dfe2d17b40362c2b9a7002e56f82271a450c0f7bb9f80d","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/86469c0fecf7778ae8dfe2d17b40362c2b9a7002e56f82271a450c0f7bb9f80d.mp3"},"caption":"看看嘴巴","narration":"拿起小镜子，慢慢说一句你好。看看说到不同地方时，嘴巴的样子会怎样变化。"},{"art":{"alt":"声音排队","panel":3,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.509,"sha256":"97702caa2dca0b96abcaabf9ab8ad2684f5fdfb5f78145cac28a73a77c86d427","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/97702caa2dca0b96abcaabf9ab8ad2684f5fdfb5f78145cac28a73a77c86d427.mp3"},"caption":"声音排队","narration":"先拍一下手，再轻轻拍两下。把声音排好队，邀请家人学一学你的节奏。"}],"gradeCode":"primary_1","presentationSha256":"75a3d465a1810ae86d4a2b5b1a79fea0fbc63ed677d427b8e39ebfd1fa24f5f4","scenes":[{"art":{"alt":"声音也有先和后","panel":3,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":13.925,"sha256":"1fbc790a9a94a933ea1a4cc9743b72ba10c6f34b0e6e7cbcc9a63992e979bf69","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/1fbc790a9a94a933ea1a4cc9743b72ba10c6f34b0e6e7cbcc9a63992e979bf69.mp3"},"caption":"声音也有先和后","narration":"看，小朋友在轮流拍手。先拍一下，停一停，再拍一下。声音有先后，听的时候，要把小耳朵准备好。"},{"art":{"alt":"找一个声音游戏","panel":1,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":6.79,"sha256":"b53b97c40871dadb37266d65d68e7c8a1c79825a282f011fd8cba7553aafc488","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/b53b97c40871dadb37266d65d68e7c8a1c79825a282f011fd8cba7553aafc488.mp3"},"caption":"找一个声音游戏","narration":"你可以先听别人说，也可以照镜子看嘴巴，还可以拍手。选一幅图，跟着玩一玩。"},{"art":{"alt":"听一遍，再拍一遍","panel":3,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.347,"sha256":"748ecc4e0758808f6dc1bdf4fd8349f1fcccea5b8b541b912afc20312297a0a9","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/748ecc4e0758808f6dc1bdf4fd8349f1fcccea5b8b541b912afc20312297a0a9.mp3"},"caption":"听一遍，再拍一遍","narration":"请家人先拍一下，停一会儿，再拍两下。你先听完，再照着拍。顺序记住了吗？可以交换着当小老师。"},{"art":{"alt":"慢慢连起来","panel":0,"sha256":"5427ad4e42dceb6be4ca5772967a87e5d14e6ff9c7b4201d6b18e474b4fab6d2","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/sounds-5427ad4e42dceb6b.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":10.137,"sha256":"c49b96690fdf62e6d0fa0032019711cfdf3ae8685cb4819adee0af10b874f9a7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/c49b96690fdf62e6d0fa0032019711cfdf3ae8685cb4819adee0af10b874f9a7.mp3"},"caption":"慢慢连起来","narration":"我们练习了认真听，还练习了按顺序模仿。学习新的拼音时，也先听老师示范，再慢慢跟着读。一步一步来就好。"}],"schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide.v1","sourceContentSha256":"235f58c631a571f25fbb4aa937e4c5414f02d50deb1cd938837d92f65a8ef325","title":"声音排排队"},"story-questions":{"choices":[{"art":{"alt":"发生什么？","panel":0,"sha256":"fdffc8684c03835ea17d297fcd840e13d64465109f69611789e48e45c74fba5c","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/story-fdffc8684c03835e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.247,"sha256":"4941c07db42e5a928315b1404048688cf42766268839711172276313b101cb6e","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/4941c07db42e5a928315b1404048688cf42766268839711172276313b101cb6e.mp3"},"caption":"发生什么？","narration":"你可以问，发生什么事了？看看小雨点，再看看小兔子。试着说一说，小兔子遇到了什么事。"},{"art":{"alt":"有什么办法？","panel":1,"sha256":"fdffc8684c03835ea17d297fcd840e13d64465109f69611789e48e45c74fba5c","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/story-fdffc8684c03835e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":7.474,"sha256":"74fc1f190dcb5e1c1da8e970dd14743235027e173cb959b25d006a7512dd3d7e","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/74fc1f190dcb5e1c1da8e970dd14743235027e173cb959b25d006a7512dd3d7e.mp3"},"caption":"有什么办法？","narration":"你可以问，小松鼠想到了什么办法？看看它手里的大叶子。叶子能帮上什么忙呢？"},{"art":{"alt":"为什么呢？","panel":2,"sha256":"fdffc8684c03835ea17d297fcd840e13d64465109f69611789e48e45c74fba5c","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/story-fdffc8684c03835e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":7.56,"sha256":"83bbe2b4311548652cfe65b318ef861a8152d6db20b459283592cafedb467c03","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/83bbe2b4311548652cfe65b318ef861a8152d6db20b459283592cafedb467c03.mp3"},"caption":"为什么呢？","narration":"你可以问，为什么它们要站在一起？看看头顶的叶子。把你想到的原因，告诉家人吧。"}],"gradeCode":"primary_1","presentationSha256":"d72ba05f18b45495a37b05cd92a9042387f645b86172ad42d1f41e1c2ab583b5","scenes":[{"art":{"alt":"下雨了，怎么办？","panel":0,"sha256":"fdffc8684c03835ea17d297fcd840e13d64465109f69611789e48e45c74fba5c","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/story-fdffc8684c03835e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.691,"sha256":"8d88845cd1941cfaf7db483f50d38ab7f7bd79500a7d0b4a03f0272405f47d0f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/8d88845cd1941cfaf7db483f50d38ab7f7bd79500a7d0b4a03f0272405f47d0f.mp3"},"caption":"下雨了，怎么办？","narration":"森林里下起了小雨。小松鼠看见小兔子站在树下。小兔子也许需要帮助。你猜，小松鼠会想到什么办法？"},{"art":{"alt":"你想问哪一幅？","panel":1,"sha256":"fdffc8684c03835ea17d297fcd840e13d64465109f69611789e48e45c74fba5c","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/story-fdffc8684c03835e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":8.594,"sha256":"e263c1a3b18f56d6c3276c1f02e3579c5b9a3078a27401351a735ed8b5ab7789","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/e263c1a3b18f56d6c3276c1f02e3579c5b9a3078a27401351a735ed8b5ab7789.mp3"},"caption":"你想问哪一幅？","narration":"小松鼠找来了一片大叶子，后来和小兔子躲在了一起。点一幅图，我们试着问一个小问题。"},{"art":{"alt":"把故事说给家人听","panel":2,"sha256":"fdffc8684c03835ea17d297fcd840e13d64465109f69611789e48e45c74fba5c","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/story-fdffc8684c03835e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.778,"sha256":"ed95aeab0c04f5c7f0dae2e96106ee2240e2322765728e2b95937507503b7ece","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/ed95aeab0c04f5c7f0dae2e96106ee2240e2322765728e2b95937507503b7ece.mp3"},"caption":"把故事说给家人听","narration":"看着这幅图，用自己的话说一说，小松鼠怎样帮助了小兔子。你可以先说下雨了，再说后来怎么样。不用和老师说得一样。"},{"art":{"alt":"带着问题，去阅读","panel":3,"sha256":"fdffc8684c03835ea17d297fcd840e13d64465109f69611789e48e45c74fba5c","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/story-fdffc8684c03835e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":12.976,"sha256":"d379766e806cd33196d9758cc938c8442b01270d7a7ee2f178195f11babe0a6e","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/d379766e806cd33196d9758cc938c8442b01270d7a7ee2f178195f11babe0a6e.mp3"},"caption":"带着问题，去阅读","narration":"雨停了，两个朋友一起看见了彩虹。读故事时，我们可以问，谁在做什么，为什么会这样。带着小问题，新的故事会更有趣。"}],"schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide.v1","sourceContentSha256":"9ca807215a0e785b0cc49f27e1438448e24cb21ea6b09e40d0228b6bccd82ae6","title":"一片叶子的故事"},"welcome-school":{"choices":[{"art":{"alt":"认识朋友","panel":0,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":10.138,"sha256":"45b20d4ca023a82df94d5491d51081f8f4d6958f72a5fe874fa500f50961ce36","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/45b20d4ca023a82df94d5491d51081f8f4d6958f72a5fe874fa500f50961ce36.mp3"},"caption":"认识朋友","narration":"看，两个小朋友正在挥手。你也可以试试，先说你好，再说自己的名字。轮到别人说的时候，我们认真听。"},{"art":{"alt":"翻开图书","panel":2,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.884,"sha256":"764a9a763470d2ce18aef6f1b2c1fd49619bb293447add522a85e6dbd2c1060e","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/764a9a763470d2ce18aef6f1b2c1fd49619bb293447add522a85e6dbd2c1060e.mp3"},"caption":"翻开图书","narration":"图画书里有好多发现。轻轻翻一页，找一个你喜欢的地方，指给家人看，再说一说你看见了什么。"},{"art":{"alt":"分享画画","panel":3,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.629,"sha256":"59e35f5d5520825685ca0c9daf6f383d307d6d5bd50da3c0736ab18bffdc72b8","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/59e35f5d5520825685ca0c9daf6f383d307d6d5bd50da3c0736ab18bffdc72b8.mp3"},"caption":"分享画画","narration":"把你画的东西给朋友看，说一说你画的是什么。朋友有不同的发现，也听听他怎么说。"}],"gradeCode":"primary_1","presentationSha256":"5ff6e60ad8154d8e0c762dfecaa92ec55d087f135f14a914dade95d94754b283","scenes":[{"art":{"alt":"书包里有什么？","panel":3,"sha256":"d6a8bff5a1540f167473c6e585c8d7e49ef9de2696205854311be1ce5268399f","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/literacy-d6a8bff5a1540f16.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.285,"sha256":"7a3f3d66472ec7717595cfe16405b3d29683892eb4d802d616294e6cccc6394d","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/7a3f3d66472ec7717595cfe16405b3d29683892eb4d802d616294e6cccc6394d.mp3"},"caption":"书包里有什么？","narration":"新的一天开始啦！看看这个小书包，里面有图画书，还有笔袋。你的书包里有什么？用手指给家人看一看。"},{"art":{"alt":"选一个校园发现","panel":0,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":9.279,"sha256":"db133cdc760c9999f53661a4185292c6a5b413271bdf782406135dd91f4eb345","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/db133cdc760c9999f53661a4185292c6a5b413271bdf782406135dd91f4eb345.mp3"},"caption":"选一个校园发现","narration":"学校里，有可以交的朋友，有可以看的书，还有可以分享的画。点一幅图，跟着老师试一试。"},{"art":{"alt":"笑一笑，介绍自己","panel":0,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":12.554,"sha256":"9acc8e0a9cf128aa1a41031134768960b294fe287ab8e865513730a9498ac336","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/9acc8e0a9cf128aa1a41031134768960b294fe287ab8e865513730a9498ac336.mp3"},"caption":"笑一笑，介绍自己","narration":"想象你遇见了一位新同学。看着他的眼睛，笑一笑，说，你好，我叫。再说出自己的名字。慢慢说就很好。"},{"art":{"alt":"一起走进新课堂","panel":2,"sha256":"7bd789d3a99f0a0e67fdea81257ffffbbbeb3d6cb1a174614e91cd5e27a53dd7","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/everyday-7bd789d3a99f0a0e.png"},"audio":{"durationSeconds":11.861,"sha256":"a96b8452aa26ace0e6ca0681eafb1c777dee30efdb3c1784cc8e0e8a88183be6","src":"/textbooks/picture-guide-v1/a96b8452aa26ace0e6ca0681eafb1c777dee30efdb3c1784cc8e0e8a88183be6.mp3"},"caption":"一起走进新课堂","narration":"会打招呼，会认真听别人说话，就能开始我们的新课堂啦。以后遇到不明白的事情，可以举手告诉老师。我们一起去看看课本吧。"}],"schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide.v1","sourceContentSha256":"bc802da100001a917068f5c1770bb8b74437fe694b2fcd1b5c36aff29cf38f98","title":"你好，小学！"}},"planSha256":"74d14a82df91e15ec152bda6162ccb2ebf5e18932c1e15c79768376a5dbbbce6","revisionId":"20260924-directory-3","schemaVersion":"mira.textbook.picture-guide-pack.v1"}